Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.35,0:00:03.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.67,0:00:05.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这具皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This vessel...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.04,0:00:08.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用笼子的符文和咒语做了防护\N{\fnArial\fs30}...it's been warded with spellwork from the Cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.98,0:00:11.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I own you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.27,0:00:12.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可能有凯莉·克莱恩的线索了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I have a lead on Kelly Kline.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.82,0:00:14.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她跟地狱王子大衮在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's with Dagon, Prince of Hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.60,0:00:15.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在爱达荷州  科达伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}in Coeur d'Alene, Idaho.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.19,0:00:17.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾琳·莱希\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eileen Leahy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.43,0:00:24.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果需要什么一定联系我  哪怕只想有人陪陪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel free to drop a line, even if you just wanna hang out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.74,0:00:27.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在肯德里克斯对狼人进行过深入研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did extensive research at Kendricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:27.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like our --
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.65,0:00:29.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-霍格沃茨吗  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hogwarts? - ‭Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.28,0:00:31.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真好  找谁呢  混蛋捉鬼队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Who you gonna call? Douchebusters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.96,0:00:34.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bravo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.40,0:00:37.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在跟他们合作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're working with these people now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.91,0:00:39.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们能力越强  我们也越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}The better they are, the better we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.14,0:00:43.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你把她怎么了  -我有命在身\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did you do to her? - I had orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.16,0:00:44.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you killed her?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.22,0:00:45.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以再给你个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll give you a second chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.67,0:00:47.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别搞砸了  不会再有一次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just don't mess it up. There won't be a third.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.88,0:00:50.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.73,0:00:53.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(英国  伦敦城外)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.12,0:00:54.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得她找我们什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think she wants?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.38,0:00:56.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.48,0:00:59.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(肯德里克斯学院)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.86,0:01:03.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你圣诞回家吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going home for Christmas?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.31,0:01:06.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  我忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.05,0:01:09.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会像以往一样待在这儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be here, as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.52,0:01:21.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.57,0:01:22.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,校长夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Headmistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.39,0:01:24.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.10,0:01:52.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蒂莫西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timothy,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.66,0:01:53.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,米克尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.67,0:01:57.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们都在肯德里克斯通过了诸多试炼\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have both conquered many trials here at Kendricks,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.04,0:02:00.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要么是靠天赋\N{\fnArial\fs30}either through natural talent
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.93,0:02:04.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要么是靠勤奋\N{\fnArial\fs30}or good old-fashioned hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.46,0:02:06.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}But today,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.68,0:02:09.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天  我们要看看你们中谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}today we'll learn which of you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.10,0:02:11.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能进入训练的下一阶段\N{\fnArial\fs30}matriculates to the next level of training.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.87,0:02:16.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,本组织要承担重要的工作  先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}This organization does important work, gentlemen --
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.43,0:02:19.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的工作让数百万人\N{\fnArial\fs30}work which allows millions of people
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.49,0:02:22.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,晚上可以安然入睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}to sleep safely in their beds at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.30,0:02:25.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但要做这份工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in order to do this work,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.96,0:02:28.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要保护那些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to protect those people,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.26,0:02:32.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要学员能使用他们的技能\N{\fnArial\fs30}we need cadets who will employ their skills
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.04,0:02:37.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能毫不质疑地执行命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}and execute orders without question.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.87,0:02:41.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因此\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.21,0:02:52.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们中只有一人能离开这间屋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}...only one of you will be leaving this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.40,0:02:57.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祝你们好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.65,0:03:18.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的抵抗很顽强\N{\fnArial\fs30}He -- he fought well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.76,0:03:21.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不想死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.75,0:03:26.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但准则另有要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet the Code demands otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.03,0:03:31.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好  戴维斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well played, Mr. Davies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.77,0:03:44.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第12季第17集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.59,0:03:51.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们谈过之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, after we talked,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.85,0:03:54.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你又回爱达荷州科达伦了  -对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you went back to Coeur d'Alene, Idaho? - ‭Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.17,0:03:56.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.27,0:03:57.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是凯莉·克莱恩最后被见到的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last place anybody saw Kelly Kline go --
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.72,0:03:59.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得该去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured I'd take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.38,0:04:01.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.13,0:04:03.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原来  她走之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And turns out, right after she left,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.72,0:04:06.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人烧了一间老仓库\N{\fnArial\fs30}somebody burned down an old warehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.63,0:04:07.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我调查了一番\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did some digging.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.64,0:04:09.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.76,0:04:11.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.88,0:04:14.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么  监控画面吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are those? Security shots?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.20,0:04:16.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  那是凯莉进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. There's Kelly goin' in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.63,0:04:22.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-干得好  艾琳  -谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice work, Eileen. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.30,0:04:23.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟她在一起的女人是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this chick with her,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.35,0:04:25.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,佩特·班纳塔(歌手)模仿者吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that, uh, Pat Benatar wannabe?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.14,0:04:27.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肯定是大衮了  嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must be Dagon, I guess. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.88,0:04:30.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了  好吧  那...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome. Okay, so --
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.75,0:04:31.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.31,0:04:34.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯莉和大衮去过这地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly and Dagon go crash this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.58,0:04:36.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后那里就被烧了  巧合吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then it gets torched. Coincidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.77,0:04:38.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-不是  -绝对不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Hell, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.61,0:04:40.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那是什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, what are we lookin' at here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.07,0:04:42.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还在查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.62,0:04:44.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去查到他们吧  艾琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, go get 'em, Eileen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.39,0:04:46.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这么打算的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.10,0:04:50.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.78,0:04:51.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.24,0:04:57.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-好有爱  -得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's cute. - ‭Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.21,0:05:01.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是说  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just saying, Dean,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.24,0:05:04.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就算有小卡和我们认识的每个猎人一起找\N{\fnArial\fs30}even with Cass and every Hunter we know working this,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.90,0:05:06.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还是几乎什么都查不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}we still got basically nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.46,0:05:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少  或许克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least, you know, maybe Crowley --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.94,0:05:12.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行  我们不能找克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, dude, we're not calling Crowley -- ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.59,0:05:16.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小伙子们  来喝一杯吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, boys. Do come and have a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.97,0:05:20.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你闯进了我们家吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you break into our house?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.54,0:05:22.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的家  这是记录者的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our house. Men of Letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.88,0:05:24.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们知道你们的钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know your key opens
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.18,0:05:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能打开全世界的每个分部会所吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}every chapter house in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.45,0:05:30.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们说过会再给我个机会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you did say you'd give me a second chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.69,0:05:32.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那不代表我们想一起喝酒消遣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that doesn't mean we wanna hang out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.00,0:05:34.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你来有事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You here for a reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.55,0:05:37.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  还挺急的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am, and it's a bit urgent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.44,0:05:39.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一段时间之前  总部记录到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some time ago, the home office recorded
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.39,0:05:42.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一段宇宙震波\N{\fnArial\fs30}some sort of cosmic shock wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.24,0:05:43.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很罕见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.68,0:05:45.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-几个月来...  -拿非利人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And after a few months of -- - Nephilim.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.73,0:05:47.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.86,0:05:49.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.51,0:05:51.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-怎么知道的  -说来话长\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How? - ‭Sort of a long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.99,0:05:53.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I've got time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.93,0:05:58.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法附身了总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Lucifer jacked the President...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.54,0:06:02.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搞大了他女友的肚子\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and then knocked up his girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.45,0:06:05.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在  她在跟大衮逃命\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, she is on the run with Dagon,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.03,0:06:07.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大衮是地狱王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}who is a Prince of Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.59,0:06:10.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊  你们没告诉我是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see. And you didn't tell me this because...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.05,0:06:13.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为这事算是个机密\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause it's kind of a need-to-know kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.72,0:06:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,魔鬼要有...\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Devil is having a...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.81,0:06:17.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,孩子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}child.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.63,0:06:20.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这事似乎是我们需要知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems like something we'd need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.12,0:06:24.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这女人现在在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is this woman now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.04,0:06:25.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.85,0:06:26.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,本来在我们手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.52,0:06:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们想帮她的  但她...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tried to help her, but, she, uh --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.83,0:06:30.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-她跑了  -嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We lost her. - ‭Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.12,0:06:32.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  她本来在你们手上  你们却放过了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. You -- you had her? And you let her live?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.76,0:06:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不怪凯莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it's not Kelly's fault, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.38,0:06:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她不知道她男友变成路西法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't know Lucifer was her boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.22,0:06:38.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然  这种事谁都可能碰上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sure, yeah. It could happen to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.25,0:06:40.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再说  她原本答应打胎的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus, she'd agreed to end the pregnancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.17,0:06:42.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜她后来改主意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I guess she changed her mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.30,0:06:44.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就算凯莉知道了前因后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even with everything Kelly knew, it...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.46,0:06:47.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那还是她的孩子  她做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was still her kid. She couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.25,0:06:48.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你们就该动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you should have!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.30,0:06:52.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们就该立刻一枪崩了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've shot her between the eyes immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.97,0:06:54.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  因为换你就会那么做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, why? 'Cause that's what you would've done?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.18,0:06:56.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像你杀了那个狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of like you killed that werewolf?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.79,0:06:59.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我记得  那让你受的惊可不小\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause from what I remember, that really messed you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.44,0:07:01.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  因为你很看重第二次机会什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, 'cause you're so big on second chances and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.37,0:07:02.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah -- yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.97,0:07:05.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没说那会轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not saying it was gonna be easy,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.41,0:07:07.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但这是准则的要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the Code demands it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.66,0:07:09.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准则\N{\fnArial\fs30} "The Code."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.84,0:07:12.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是什么狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not some werewolf. Do --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.24,0:07:13.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们知道如果这天谴之物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea what will happen
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.97,0:07:15.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,诞生了会怎么样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}if this abomination is born?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.71,0:07:16.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,米克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mick...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.12,0:07:20.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在处理了  好吗  我们会找到她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're handling it, all right? We'll find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.78,0:07:24.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在那之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}So until then...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.33,0:07:27.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们喝酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say we drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.75,0:07:32.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大衮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.13,0:07:35.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大衮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dagon...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.02,0:07:36.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.53,0:07:37.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我听到了  陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.89,0:07:40.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说说我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}News of my son...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.04,0:07:42.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一切都好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All is well?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.45,0:07:44.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}As can be expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.63,0:07:47.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那...容器呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the, uh...container?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.67,0:07:54.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她应该能撑到时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}She should last as long as needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.19,0:07:55.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那最好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she better.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.95,0:07:57.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别让我失望  大衮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't fail me, Dagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.87,0:08:00.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别再辜负我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.11,0:08:10.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,米克  外面没人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mick, no one's out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.30,0:08:12.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们逃跑  可能不会被抓\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we run, we might not get caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.48,0:08:13.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以去找我父亲  他会...\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can go to my father. He'll --
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.66,0:08:15.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,关门  蒂莫西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close the door, Timothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.88,0:08:21.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要学员能毫不质疑地\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need cadets who will execute orders
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.72,0:08:23.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,执行命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}without question.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.87,0:08:27.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,米克  我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mick, we have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.67,0:08:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们中只有一人能离开这间屋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one of you will be leaving this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.09,0:08:32.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,米克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.07,0:08:35.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祝你们好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.73,0:08:39.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm...I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.55,0:08:52.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.12,0:08:54.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你昨晚没报告情况  戴维斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't report in last night, Mr. Davies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.47,0:08:56.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-有什么原因吗  -没有  夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is there a reason? - ‭No, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.06,0:08:59.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我当时还在做调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I was, uh, I was still in investigation mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.86,0:09:02.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我本想通知您的  -那温家人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was gonna inform you. - And the Winchesters?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.35,0:09:04.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有些进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}Making some progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.82,0:09:09.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进来  罗林斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in, Mr. Rawlings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.58,0:09:12.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道贝维尔夫人认为他们无可救药吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are aware that Lady Bevell feels that they are hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.21,0:09:14.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我收拾了她惹的祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the one cleaning up her mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.54,0:09:16.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,海斯博士  据我所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Hess, last I heard,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.45,0:09:18.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你和其他领导人\N{\fnArial\fs30}you and the rest of the leadership
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.08,0:09:19.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,认为拉拢温家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}felt getting the Winchesters
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.09,0:09:21.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是拉拢美国猎人的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}was key to bringing the American Hunters on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.50,0:09:22.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是在尽力实现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just trying to make that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.99,0:09:25.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  情况有变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well, things change.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.22,0:09:28.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.56,0:09:31.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个拿非利人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This... nephilim.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.04,0:09:35.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可怕的大麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something big and bad
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.95,0:09:38.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就要来了  戴维斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}is on its way, Mr. Davies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.69,0:09:41.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要马上解决美国的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need the situation in America settled now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.26,0:09:44.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  我不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.00,0:09:48.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我说清楚点吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let me make it blisteringly simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.36,0:09:50.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have time
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.84,0:09:54.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迎合几个肮脏的殖民地人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to court a handful of mangy Colonials.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.15,0:09:55.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.23,0:09:59.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以萨姆和迪恩还有其他他们那群浑人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So either Sam and Dean and the rest of their ill-bred lot
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.11,0:10:00.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要么学会服从\N{\fnArial\fs30}learn to obey,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.39,0:10:04.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要么你把他们交给凯奇先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you turn them over to Mr. Ketch...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.83,0:10:07.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后重新开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and start fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.82,0:10:10.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我不认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't think --
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.11,0:10:12.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是讨论\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not a discussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.47,0:10:13.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.30,0:10:15.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听到了吗  米克尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you hearing me, Michael?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.26,0:10:18.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要么同化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Assimilate or
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.62,0:10:20.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要么消灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}eliminate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.79,0:10:39.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你需要个枕头什么的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Do you need a pillow or...whatever?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.62,0:10:44.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.88,0:10:47.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我总感到一些奇怪的疼痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep getting these weird little pains.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.43,0:10:50.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我相信你没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.47,0:10:52.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  因为你怀孕的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Because this is how you felt
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.77,0:10:54.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也感觉到这样的疼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the times you were pregnant?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.58,0:10:58.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要见医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to see a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.09,0:11:03.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,医生是不会理解这孩子的  你都不怎么理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}No doctor will understand this child. You barely do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.26,0:11:07.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在这里待太久了  该移动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been here too long. We should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.93,0:11:08.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.21,0:11:13.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说会帮我的  我想看医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said that you would help me. I wanna see a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.59,0:11:21.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我确保宝宝没事之前哪里都不会去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going anywhere until I know my baby's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.79,0:11:37.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你气色好差\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.98,0:11:39.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你气色更差\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you look crappier.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.91,0:11:42.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真佩服米克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta hand it to Mick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.03,0:11:45.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你开个头  他能喝下太平洋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, you get him started, that guy can drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.46,0:11:46.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就很能喝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we can drink,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.60,0:11:49.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他简直是"能喝"金牌得主\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he's got, like, the "Can Drink" gold medal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.66,0:11:52.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你最近跟妈妈通过话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you talk to Mom lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.52,0:11:54.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心你们妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shouldn't worry about your Mum.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.08,0:11:56.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她和凯奇是很棒的组合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her and Ketch make quite the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.40,0:11:59.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会希望你妈跟他合作吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you want your mom working with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.97,0:12:02.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I can't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.78,0:12:04.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我根本不认识我妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never really knew my mum.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.01,0:12:05.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或是我爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.64,0:12:09.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我原本流落街头  直到被记录者发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was on the streets till the Men of Letters found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.25,0:12:11.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们怎么发现你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did they find you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.52,0:12:16.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我偷了一个记录者的钱包\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh, picked a member's pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.72,0:12:19.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是有意的  我就是想偷个几镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not on purpose. I was just after a couple of quid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.28,0:12:23.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结果偷到了古巴比伦被诅咒的钱币\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I got a cursed coin from Ancient Babylon instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.86,0:12:26.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然  这种事谁都能碰上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sure. That could happen to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.05,0:12:29.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记录者认为我挺有前途\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Men of Letters decided I showed promised
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.47,0:12:30.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就让我加入了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and signed me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.27,0:12:35.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们给了我一份生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}They gave me a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.62,0:12:37.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们...\N{\fnArial\fs30}They, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.13,0:12:43.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.99,0:12:46.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Always.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.11,0:12:49.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有伏特加吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got any vodka?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.50,0:12:53.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.08,0:12:58.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就是凯莉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be Kelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.04,0:12:59.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是她的...伴侣吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're her...partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.48,0:13:01.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.77,0:13:02.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,生育指导\N{\fnArial\fs30}Birth coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.30,0:13:04.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.76,0:13:08.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯莉的体征和初步检测都很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Kelly's vitals and preliminary labs were great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.86,0:13:10.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就做个B超\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're just gonna do a quick sonogram.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.22,0:13:12.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真有这必要吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that really necessary?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.99,0:13:14.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.03,0:13:17.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们希望孩子住得开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want the baby to be a happy camper.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.73,0:13:19.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.90,0:13:22.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  凯莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Kelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.21,0:13:24.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把单子掀起来  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just lift up there, please. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.35,0:13:26.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要在镜头上涂点凝胶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna put a little bit of gel on the camera,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.50,0:13:28.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以会有点凉凉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}so it might be a little bit cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.18,0:13:30.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.74,0:13:32.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说"茄子"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say "Cheese."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.46,0:13:33.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,茄子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.15,0:13:38.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.73,0:13:44.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看上去很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's looking good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.96,0:13:54.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.67,0:13:58.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一切看上去都没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything looks a-okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.07,0:13:59.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一切看上去都没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything looks a-okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.88,0:14:03.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧  凯莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, Kelly?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.05,0:14:07.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的宝宝是个小天使  就像我说的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your baby is a little angel, just like I've been saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.27,0:14:11.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这会有点尴尬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I know this can be a little bit awkward,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.58,0:14:13.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但为了给小家伙建立病例\N{\fnArial\fs30}but for the little champ's medical record,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.77,0:14:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能跟我说说孩子的父亲吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}what can you tell me about his father?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.80,0:14:24.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伟人竟堕落至此啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the mighty have sunk, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.51,0:14:32.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乖狗狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.16,0:14:42.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,狗狗想玩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Puppy want to play?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.42,0:14:53.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.97,0:15:15.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.90,0:15:26.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在给你你想要的  屈服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm giving you what you want -- submission.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.21,0:15:28.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-为什么  -为什么不呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.77,0:15:31.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我明白了这里的规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured out the rules of the house,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.44,0:15:34.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,考虑到一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}and...well, all things considered,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.79,0:15:38.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我宁可待在这里  而不是在笼子里发霉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'd rather be here than rotting in the Cage
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.08,0:15:41.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我流着口水  疯疯癫癫而且并不好玩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}with my drooling, insane -- and not in a fun way --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.27,0:15:42.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,弟弟米迦勒待在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}little bro Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.01,0:15:44.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.79,0:15:47.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.52,0:15:49.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你的游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your game,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.25,0:15:52.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}your rules, so, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.03,0:15:56.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以  我可以配合\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figure I can work with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.56,0:16:01.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You win.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.99,0:16:05.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What now...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.50,0:16:08.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}sire?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.36,0:16:13.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-凯奇  -上报一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ketch. - ‭Quick update --
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.62,0:16:15.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些流浪汉原来是易形者\N{\fnArial\fs30}the skels turned out to be shape-shifters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.89,0:16:18.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-杀了一群七个人  -是八个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Killed a clan of seven. - ‭Eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.70,0:16:21.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她说是八个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight, she says.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.07,0:16:23.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经知道不该跟她争了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've learned not to argue.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.01,0:16:26.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能搞定文书工作吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, you'll make with the typey typey, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.82,0:16:28.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会提交报告的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll file the report.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.10,0:16:29.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了  再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Splendid. Ciao.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.57,0:16:33.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你和米克\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you and Mick...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.81,0:16:36.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一直是朋友吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}longtime friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.13,0:16:39.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,更像是幸存者吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}More...survivors than friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.77,0:16:42.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们曾一起上学\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were in school together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.40,0:16:45.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主修杀人  辅修搞破坏吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Major in murder, minor in mayhem? ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.36,0:16:46.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.51,0:16:52.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听说你的训练更多是即兴发挥的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gather your training was a bit more...improvisational?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.19,0:16:56.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们边干边学\N{\fnArial\fs30}We learned on the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.27,0:17:02.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后你  放弃了那种生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you... gave it all up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.41,0:17:08.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想要平静的普通生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted a quiet, normal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.87,0:17:12.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你不久前\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet, there you were,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.34,0:17:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还杀了一堆易形者\N{\fnArial\fs30}up to your elbows in shifter guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.43,0:17:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,温太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭Mrs. Winchester...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.83,0:17:22.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为你就喜欢危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you're drawn to danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.83,0:17:28.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.37,0:17:48.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉打搅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to interrupt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.26,0:17:53.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没那个必要  戴维斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's really no need for that, Mr. Davies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.37,0:17:54.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们认识吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.21,0:17:57.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是兰尼·罗林斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Renny. Rawlings.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.50,0:18:00.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从肯德里克斯毕业后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been working directly for Dr. Hess
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.03,0:18:01.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一直在海斯博士手下工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}since I graduated Kendricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.30,0:18:03.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是班级状元\N{\fnArial\fs30}Top of my class.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.69,0:18:05.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.91,0:18:08.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.84,0:18:10.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,海斯博士派我连夜赶来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Hess sent me on the overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.43,0:18:13.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想帮你把手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought you could use an extra set of hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.86,0:18:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也就是说  你是她的走狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, to put it another way, you're her lapdog.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.03,0:18:21.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来看着我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here to keep an eye on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.93,0:18:24.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是来帮忙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.42,0:18:26.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.70,0:18:28.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别干扰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.78,0:18:31.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那恐怕不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid that's not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.29,0:18:51.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  我们今天关门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, we're closed for the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.62,0:18:53.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是你的病人病例吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those your patient files?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.97,0:18:56.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我病人的病例跟你无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}My patient history is none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.96,0:19:08.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的语音信箱  请留你的语音邮件\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}This is my voicemail. Make your voice a mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.68,0:19:11.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  小卡  我给你打过三通电话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Cass. I've called you three times now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.09,0:19:14.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能不能回电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you call me back?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.77,0:19:16.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们查到大衮的线索了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got a line on Dagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.61,0:19:17.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.19,0:19:21.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你查过了那晚那间爱达荷州仓库被烧前\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you ran the plates of every car that drove past
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.08,0:19:23.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有经过了它的车的车牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}that warehouse in Idaho just before it burned down?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.91,0:19:28.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  大部分车是本地的  但有一辆不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Most of them were local, but one wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.10,0:19:31.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,查到注册在一个德米特·考普名下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It came up registered to Dermott Culp.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.26,0:19:33.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.31,0:19:36.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而他一年前失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he went missing a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.32,0:19:38.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.47,0:19:40.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我追踪了他的车  在爱荷华州\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tracked his car to Iowa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.86,0:19:42.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看到他从一栋建筑里出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found him coming out of a building
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.01,0:19:45.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还扛着一具尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}carrying a dead body.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.67,0:19:51.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,德米特是个杀手喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Dermott's a killer?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.19,0:19:53.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,德米特是个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dermott's a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.74,0:19:59.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.45,0:20:01.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.13,0:20:05.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, one of Crowley's?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.41,0:20:08.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为大衮工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Works for Dagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.18,0:20:09.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,替她掩盖踪迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Covers her tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.21,0:20:14.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(凯莉·克莱恩)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.39,0:20:15.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(删除)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.38,0:20:18.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明智\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.22,0:20:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥们  别夸坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, don't compliment the bad guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.20,0:20:25.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道凯莉现在在哪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So do you know where Kelly is now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.16,0:20:30.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  但德米特\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but before Dermott got
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.18,0:20:31.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被刺中心脏之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}stabbed in the heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.54,0:20:34.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.29,0:20:37.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他给了我她的手机号\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gave me her phone number.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.73,0:20:46.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.57,0:20:54.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还算忠诚的子民\N{\fnArial\fs30}My loyal...ish subjects,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.07,0:20:58.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如今世道艰险\N{\fnArial\fs30}these troubled times,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.26,0:21:01.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你们可能不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm aware there might be some confusion
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.37,0:21:04.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该向谁效忠\N{\fnArial\fs30}as to where you're supposed to place your loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.91,0:21:07.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就算路西法被关回了笼子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even with Lucifer back in the Cage,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.58,0:21:10.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有些人想帮助他\N{\fnArial\fs30}there are those of you who would try to help him...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.24,0:21:13.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为他让你们害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}because he scares you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.26,0:21:15.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或让你们贪婪\N{\fnArial\fs30}or engorges you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.49,0:21:19.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,光是路西法能回归的可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the chance that Lucifer could come back,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.91,0:21:23.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,传言  都足以让你们中一些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the rumor, would've been enough to keep some of you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.47,0:21:26.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,密谋反对我  给我搞破坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}working against me, undermining me,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.66,0:21:29.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我找麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}being a royal pain in my...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.46,0:21:31.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我蛋疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}pert, royal ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.89,0:21:35.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但瞧啊  野兽已被驯服\N{\fnArial\fs30}But lo, the beast has been humbled.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.54,0:21:41.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他将亲口说出\N{\fnArial\fs30}From his own lips, you will hear proclaimed
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.41,0:21:44.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地狱唯一真正的统治者\N{\fnArial\fs30}the one, true leader of all Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.62,0:21:46.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}See...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.04,0:21:49.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我并不仅仅击败了魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't just beat the Devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.81,0:21:51.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还驯服了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tamed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.25,0:21:57.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这完全是出于你的自由意志吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all done of your own free will, is it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.04,0:22:00.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  王上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.40,0:22:03.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧啊  孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.06,0:22:07.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫他去哪他就去哪  我叫他做啥他就做啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}He goes where I tell him. He does what I tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.68,0:22:10.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是我的狗狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is my dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.36,0:22:14.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该表演了  马默杜克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Showtime, Marmaduke.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.34,0:22:17.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是  王上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.40,0:22:26.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他说得对  朋友们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.26,0:22:30.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地狱只有一个真正的统治者\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is only one true ruler of Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.80,0:22:31.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.70,0:22:33.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-就是我  是吧  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And that is me, is it not? - Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.16,0:22:35.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而你诚心地\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you surrender your
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.31,0:22:37.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,支持这唯一的真正统治者  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}heartfelt support to that one true ruler?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.48,0:22:39.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绝对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.23,0:22:41.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么你要对那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what do you have to say to those
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.14,0:22:45.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还不确定该服从谁的人说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}who are still unsure of whom they must obey?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.16,0:22:47.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say this --
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.36,0:22:52.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不支持这位唯一真王的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}anyone who does not support this one true king,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.03,0:22:56.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一定会遭受无法忍受的\N{\fnArial\fs30}can be assured of suffering unendurable
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.65,0:22:59.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,永恒痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}and everlasting agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.11,0:23:08.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么听不到掌声\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't hear applause.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.04,0:23:24.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,特纳医生说的很明确  我需要锌和铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Turner was very specific. I need zinc and iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.27,0:23:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.22,0:23:27.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这篇文章上还提到了钙\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this article says calcium.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.41,0:23:29.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.78,0:23:38.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克莱恩小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ms. Kline.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.07,0:23:40.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.98,0:23:42.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是特纳医生办公室的奥利弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Oliver in Dr. Turner's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.99,0:23:45.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他今天希望您来趟办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd like to see you in the office today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.57,0:23:48.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚去过  他说一切都好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh, I was just in there. He said everything was fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.67,0:23:50.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  他又看了一下您的检测结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, he looked back through your test results
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.65,0:23:52.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想跟您说些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there are some things he'd like to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.86,0:23:55.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下午5点您方便吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does 5:00 p.m. work for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.39,0:23:57.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我恐怕走不开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I-I don't think I can get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.73,0:23:59.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他说这真的很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he said it's very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.84,0:24:02.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-5点行吗  -好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 5:00 p.m.? - ‭Um...sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.05,0:24:03.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那好  到时见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, see you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.97,0:24:05.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool. ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.89,0:24:21.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你会一个人来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you'd be coming alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.51,0:24:23.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为我们已经彼此信任了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I thought we'd gotten past our trust issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.74,0:24:25.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果大衮出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if Dagon shows,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.16,0:24:26.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会需要一切帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're gonna need all the help we can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.78,0:24:29.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,兰尼·罗林斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Renny Rawlings.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.67,0:24:30.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,新来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}New man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.88,0:24:32.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.02,0:24:35.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是萨姆  这位是艾琳·莱希\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Sam. This is Eileen Leahy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.08,0:24:37.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,女妖姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, the banshee girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.90,0:24:40.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有你的档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a file.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.47,0:24:41.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,据米克告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}From what Mick tells me,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.59,0:24:43.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们都没接受过正规训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}neither of you have any formal training.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.68,0:24:45.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.21,0:24:49.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我在肯德里克斯时是班级状元  -没人在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was top of my class at Kendricks -- - No one cares.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.88,0:24:55.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我照你要求的拿来了柯尔特枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh, brought the Colt just like you asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.59,0:24:59.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但必须还回总部\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's gotta go back to HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.11,0:25:04.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,米克  我们不是已经信任彼此了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gee, Mick, I thought we'd gotten past the trust issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.76,0:25:10.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(西看医疗诊所)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.40,0:25:23.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冷静点  跟我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭Stay cool. Walk with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.18,0:25:25.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.89,0:25:55.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这些人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.42,0:25:57.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  小卡还没有消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Still no word from Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.40,0:25:59.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.68,0:26:00.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.37,0:26:02.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-他跟米克来的  -我是兰尼·罗林斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's with Mick. - I'm Renny Rawlings.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.49,0:26:04.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-肯德里克斯毕业  -好啊  不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Graduated Kendricks top of my -- - Right. I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.92,0:26:06.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.05,0:26:08.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-别  -好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't. - ‭Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.81,0:26:14.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.11,0:26:17.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我们都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, we -- we all know
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.04,0:26:18.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的处境很...\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're in a really...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.52,0:26:22.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难做  我们只是想\N{\fnArial\fs30}difficult situation, and we -- we just...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.37,0:26:23.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们想帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wanna help.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.86,0:26:25.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你管这叫帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call this helping?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.89,0:26:30.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  凯莉  那孩子  它不能...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Kelly... That kid, it's... I mean, it can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.66,0:26:31.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是路西法的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's Lucifer's.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.87,0:26:33.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.95,0:26:37.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我希望这样的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I wanted this to happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.12,0:26:41.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他利用了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He used me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.10,0:26:47.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我爱这个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I love this child.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.01,0:26:52.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你将对那个孩子毫无意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will mean absolutely nothing to that child.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.24,0:26:55.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那孩子将杀死我们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That child will kill us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.12,0:26:59.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会那样的  我们...\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's -- that's not happening, okay? We're...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.58,0:27:01.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会有办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're gonna figure something out. We will. We --
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.24,0:27:02.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-这太荒唐了  -别\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is absurd. - Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.33,0:27:12.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.23,0:28:49.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是有意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}I didn't... I didn't mean to.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.51,0:28:52.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我打的是那个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was shooting at the demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.60,0:28:54.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我...  -不  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm -- - ‭No, no, wait up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.26,0:28:55.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是个意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.10,0:28:58.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.93,0:29:00.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.18,0:29:03.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她杀了个记录者\N{\fnArial\fs30}She killed a Man of Letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.06,0:29:05.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她必须死\N{\fnArial\fs30}S-she has to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.67,0:29:07.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-那是个意外  -无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was an accident! - It doesn't matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.89,0:29:09.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要守准则\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Code.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.56,0:29:11.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  去他的准则\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, hey, screw the Code.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.38,0:29:13.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别让我更难做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make this harder than it already is.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.64,0:29:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,米克  你不用这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mick, you don't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.38,0:29:16.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.34,0:29:18.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.42,0:29:20.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.65,0:29:22.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求你  别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Please don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.85,0:29:25.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但准则另有要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Code demands otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.51,0:29:29.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求你  求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Please! ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.68,0:29:33.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,米克  听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mick, Mick, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.94,0:29:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,米克  我知道你们有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mick, look, I-I know you guys h-have this
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.35,0:29:39.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,必须盲目遵守的记录者准则\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men of Letters Code you blindly answer to, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.51,0:29:43.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但听着  你不非得那么做的  米克\N{\fnArial\fs30}look, you don't have to do that, Mick.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.03,0:29:45.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你比那强\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.08,0:29:49.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你只需要听自己的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You only have to answer to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.19,0:29:52.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你只需要做你认为正确的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You only have to do what you know is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.09,0:29:56.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你只需要遵从自己的准则\N{\fnArial\fs30}You only have to answer to your own code.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.82,0:30:11.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.62,0:30:14.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.96,0:30:30.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是没料到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that was unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.75,0:30:33.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但令人振奋\N{\fnArial\fs30}But invigorating.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.31,0:30:37.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得说  我最初遇到你时  没料到会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must say, when I first met you, I didn't see this coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.88,0:30:40.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我当时想的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}My thought at the time was,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.01,0:30:42.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我最终得杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I'll end up shooting this one"
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.09,0:30:53.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,生活处处是惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life is full of surprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.52,0:30:58.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ketch.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.06,0:31:00.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.25,0:31:03.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会想太多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not...reading anything into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.41,0:31:04.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比如\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.76,0:31:05.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比如\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.27,0:31:08.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这有任何意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}it means anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.02,0:31:12.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.67,0:31:16.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不必担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really needn't worry. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.82,0:31:18.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  我没...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truth is, I'm not...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.18,0:31:20.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个心\N{\fnArial\fs30}built for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.02,0:31:23.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜你也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I suspect you aren't either.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.99,0:31:27.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.46,0:31:30.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但那是很久以前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.42,0:31:35.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们没事了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're good?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.40,0:31:38.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.53,0:31:43.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我注意到你接受我的建议了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I notice you took my advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.66,0:31:44.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.21,0:31:49.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要做出选择  工作  还是家庭关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had a choice to make -- your work or family ties.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.13,0:31:53.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.00,0:31:56.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这并不是非此即彼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not either/or.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.75,0:31:58.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟我儿子也经历了这样的谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the same discussion with my boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.94,0:32:01.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我并不是选了猎魔不选他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not choosing hunting over them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.47,0:32:04.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么非得是选一个放弃一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does it have to be one or the other?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.33,0:32:07.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想要一切吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you want to have it all?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.15,0:32:09.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tryin' to.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.55,0:32:12.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那祝贺你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.07,0:32:21.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,情况如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how we lookin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.04,0:32:24.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定克劳力在别处忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sure Crowley is occupied elsewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.39,0:32:26.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在巡视呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's on his rounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.12,0:32:29.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力还要享受两个半小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley's got, like, two and a half more hours
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.09,0:32:31.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被人拍马屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}of gettin' his pert, royal ass kissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.35,0:32:38.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,左上象限没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, upper left quadrant is sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.36,0:32:41.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恢复状况良好  没发现增生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Restoration's holding. No laminations detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.66,0:32:45.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,左下方也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lower left, likewise.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.54,0:32:47.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的决定是正确的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made the right decision, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.27,0:32:49.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等尘埃落定\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause when the dust settles,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.28,0:32:50.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们中只会剩下一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's only gonna be one of us standing...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.73,0:32:52.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且不会是那个操着一口外国口音的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it ain't gonna be the guy with the accent,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.96,0:32:54.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.17,0:32:58.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很感动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very, very impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.02,0:33:04.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您会很高兴知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be happy to know the...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.96,0:33:06.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,皮囊完全没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}the vessel is completely sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.74,0:33:08.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,修复得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}The repairs are secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.51,0:33:11.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,安保系统呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the security system?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.37,0:33:13.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,允许克劳力把我变成他的手偶的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it is that lets Crowley turn me into his own
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.78,0:33:15.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管是什么魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}personal sock puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.07,0:33:20.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么不说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't hear words.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.19,0:33:25.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个系统还完好无损\N{\fnArial\fs30}The -- the s-system is very much I-intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.23,0:33:28.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以解除它吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can disarm it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.09,0:33:35.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我并不是个有耐心的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not really known for my patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.70,0:33:38.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我没办法  -谁有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't quite have the means -- - Who does?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.95,0:33:41.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-斯皮瓦克  是他设计了  -他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ‭Spivak. He designed -- - Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.24,0:33:43.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.89,0:33:44.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.31,0:33:46.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.78,0:33:53.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个系统安装好后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah, after the system was installed,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.11,0:33:56.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力就杀了斯皮瓦克  以保密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley killed Spivak to safeguard its secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.21,0:33:59.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.09,0:34:03.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以破解的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can crack it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.84,0:34:07.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  我需要点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-yeah. I just need some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.71,0:34:10.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会尽快的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll -- I'll be quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.35,0:34:11.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.54,0:34:14.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我要闷疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I am gettin' stir crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.10,0:34:17.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且我要当爹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm about to be a dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.42,0:34:43.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.62,0:34:47.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.47,0:34:51.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不是个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wasn't a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.06,0:34:53.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.27,0:34:55.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.89,0:35:02.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是个无心之失\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.88,0:35:24.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.25,0:35:25.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,少来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, don't even.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.19,0:35:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我试过了  但你显然不可信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried, but clearly, you can't be trusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.84,0:35:31.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是担心宝宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was worried about the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.75,0:35:33.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是想保护他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to protect him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.33,0:35:36.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  你做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, honey. You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.60,0:35:38.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you don't need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.45,0:35:39.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没骗你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.57,0:35:43.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的宝宝非常强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your baby's strong, so strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.25,0:35:47.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管发生什么  他都不会有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever happens, he is going to be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.75,0:35:51.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.79,0:35:53.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就有事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.61,0:35:58.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  那怪怪的疼痛感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, those weird little pains?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.25,0:36:01.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,后面还会更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a taste of what's to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.26,0:36:04.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为  生一个拿非利人\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause, you know, birthing a nephilim?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.50,0:36:08.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是致命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fatal.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.81,0:36:11.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一直都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.95,0:36:37.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ketch.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.37,0:36:39.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么叫我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you call me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.52,0:36:41.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.69,0:36:51.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,戴维斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Davies.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.26,0:36:54.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,海斯博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Hess.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.05,0:36:56.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你离开了伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think you left London.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.97,0:36:58.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.70,0:37:01.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我受命于\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have been tasked
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.30,0:37:04.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其他长老\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the other elders to
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.40,0:37:08.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来挽救这急转直下的局面\N{\fnArial\fs30}fix this rapidly deteriorating situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.39,0:37:12.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-夫人  拜托  我...  -你是否想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ma'am, please. I'm -- - Are you about to tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.69,0:37:15.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你已经尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you are doing the best that you can?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.37,0:37:20.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两天前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two days ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.99,0:37:22.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,据你的报告称\N{\fnArial\fs30}according to your own report,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.13,0:37:25.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你让一个地狱王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}you let a Prince of Hell escape
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.15,0:37:28.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有路西法孩子的母亲逃走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the mother of Lucifer's child.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.46,0:37:32.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而我最得力的一个手下被一名美国猎人杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one of my best men was murdered by an American Hunter,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.88,0:37:35.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-而你没有处决她  -容我说一句\N{\fnArial\fs30}- whom you allowed to live. - If I might --
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.33,0:37:37.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些猎人已经失控了\N{\fnArial\fs30}These Hunters are out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.23,0:37:41.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是温家兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}The brothers Winchester, in particular,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.46,0:37:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而贝维尔夫人早已竭力阐明\N{\fnArial\fs30}which Lady Bevell has exhaustedly documented.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.10,0:37:45.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,夫人  请您听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am, if -- if you could just listen --
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.61,0:37:48.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听什么  更多借口吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}To what? More excuses?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.97,0:37:52.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.20,0:37:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想听\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.85,0:38:00.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猎人就是狗  戴维斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunters are dogs, Mr. Davies.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.93,0:38:05.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你给他们下令  他们遵守\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give them an order, and they obey.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.21,0:38:07.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这才是正道\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.84,0:38:10.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我  是这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So tell me, do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.57,0:38:12.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们遵你的命吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do they obey you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.99,0:38:18.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.80,0:38:20.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.19,0:38:24.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.29,0:38:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找到这个艾琳·莱希  杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}this Eileen Leahy will be found and killed
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.82,0:38:31.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是准则的要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}in accordance with the Code.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.48,0:38:33.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至于温家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}As for the Winchesters,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.75,0:38:36.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如同对待所有叛逆猎人  调查他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}like any rebellious Hunter, they will be investigated.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.52,0:38:39.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果被判有罪  就处决\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, if found guilty, executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.54,0:38:41.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"如果"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"If"?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.23,0:38:43.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果被判有罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they're found guilty?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.58,0:38:46.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猎人难道不总是被判有罪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't Hunters always found guilty?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.74,0:38:48.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心点  戴维斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful, Mr. Davies.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.95,0:38:50.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.46,0:38:56.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟随了记录者一辈子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My entire life with the Men of Letters,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.23,0:38:57.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从未坏过规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never broke a rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.72,0:38:59.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.12,0:39:03.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,起初  萨姆和迪恩的行事方式令我震惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}at first I was shocked at how Sam and Dean operate.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.41,0:39:05.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但贝维尔夫人没有提到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what Lady Bevell doesn't mention
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.60,0:39:07.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是他们挽救的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the lives they've saved,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.43,0:39:08.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杀掉的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}monsters destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.50,0:39:12.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以及得到的更好的结果  那不是因为准则\N{\fnArial\fs30}and outcomes made better not because of the Code,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.26,0:39:14.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而是因为萨姆和迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}but because of Sam and Dean Winchester's
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.20,0:39:15.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道什么是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}sense of what's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.71,0:39:17.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这才是问题的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is the crux of the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.58,0:39:20.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准则不是建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Code is not a suggestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.61,0:39:22.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是绝对的要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an absolute.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.63,0:39:25.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准则将我们和怪物区分开\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Code is what separates us from the monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.55,0:39:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我们遵守的秩序\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the order by which we all live.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.44,0:39:30.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.77,0:39:36.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准则是用来逼小孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The code is what makes a young boy
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.44,0:39:37.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杀挚友的\N{\fnArial\fs30}kill his best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.73,0:39:41.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我小时候一无所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was a child, I had nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.91,0:39:45.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我欠你一切  所以我服从了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owed you everything, and I obeyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.69,0:39:50.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我现在是大人了  海斯博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm a man now, Dr. Hess,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.64,0:39:52.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看得到选择了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I can see the choices,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.07,0:39:56.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我选择做正确的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I choose to do the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.21,0:40:10.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,早\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mornin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.69,0:40:13.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,早\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mornin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.99,0:40:17.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.87,0:40:19.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有小卡的消息了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you hear anything from Cass yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.33,0:40:22.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  还失踪着\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Still MIA.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.22,0:40:24.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得他还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think he's all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.31,0:40:27.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.33,0:40:31.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾琳呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Eileen?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.17,0:40:33.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She took off.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.77,0:40:35.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说要回爱尔兰待一阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, said she's heading back to Ireland for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.64,0:40:37.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,需要点时间吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just needs some time, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.01,0:40:40.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.17,0:41:01.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎回来  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.00,0:41:16.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.72,0:41:20.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,收服美国猎人的大实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}The grand experiment recruiting American Hunters
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.33,0:41:23.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,彻底失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}has failed. Utterly.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.53,0:41:28.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要我怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you like me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.90,0:41:30.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,铲除他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exterminate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.11,0:41:35.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个不剩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every...last...one.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.58,0:41:41.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(机密文件)

